title: "[Decision tree] MemberValues.Problem" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Source and destination\nboth collections?" {shape: diamond}
q1c: "Both array, List<T> or a\nsupported interface?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: is a collection of a kind\nthis fix does not copy\n(collection-dictionary)"
q2: "Element pair has its own map,\nor the same element type?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: AutoMapper converts"
f1: "Xs = source.Xs?.Select(x => x?.ToY())\n.ToList()/.ToArray() ?? []\n(nested-collections, collection)"
q3: "Pair has exactly one map\n(own project or depended on)?" {shape: diamond}
q3s: "Same type?" {shape: diamond}
f0: "X = source.X\n(simple)"
m3: "Manual: AutoMapper converts and no\nprofile has a CreateMap (nested-no-map)"
q4: "One map, public or same project,\nno member ToY, no cycle?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: several profiles / internal /\na cycle (nested-several, nested-cycle)"
q5: "AllowNullCollections or\nAllowNullDestinationValues set?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Manual: null handling changed"
f2: "X = source.X?.ToY()[!] / .ToY() /\n?.ToY() ?? default\n(nested, nested-nullable)"
q1 -> q1c: yes
q1 -> q3: no
q1c -> m1: no
q1c -> q2: yes
q2 -> m2: no
q2 -> q5: yes
q3 -> q4: yes
q3 -> q3s: no
q3s -> f0: yes
q3s -> m3: no
